      "text": "Good afternoon. My name is Tijana Luxiyuk and I am a Vice President of the Council of Europe accessing for Group. The monitoring body established under the Council of Europe Convention on Access to Official Documents, also known as the Tromsa Convention. It is my pleasure to speak with you today about how artificial intelligence can help unlock and promote access to government information. We live in a time when access to reliable information is more important than ever. Information allows citizens to hold their governments accountable to take part in public debates and to make informed decisions. During times of crisis, it stands as a conestone of democracy. Without equal access to trustworthy information, societies become vulnerable to disinformation and mistrust. Access to official information is not optional. It's a fundamental",
